{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"a04f7f8e-a269-4f00-b42c-6d4f1c456cb4","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have implemented the analytics events from [EVENTS.md](file:///private/tmp/h-CYF8rm/docs/EVENTS.md) on the registration and offers screens using the existing `Analytics` wrapper.\n\n### Summary of Actions\n1. **Queried Worklore**:\n   - Consulted the `worklore` MCP server with `suggest_for_project` and fetched story `2026-10-07-posthog-free-tier-gone-in-days-flutter-sent-an-event-per-key`.\n   - Applied its best practices to avoid event quota exhaustion: fired text field input events once on first input rather than per keystroke, listened to slider adjustments via `onChangeEnd`, and captured scroll events via `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e`.\n\n2. **Implemented Events**:\n   - [`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart`](file:///private/tmp/h-CYF8rm/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart):\n     - `registration_email_started`: fired once when the email text field first receives input (no PII sent).\n     - `registration_phone_started`: fired once when the phone text field first receives input (no PII sent).\n     - `loan_amount_changed`: fired on slider drag completion (`onChangeEnd`) with `amount` (int).\n     - `terms_accepted`: fired when terms checkbox is checked.\n     - `registration_continue_tapped`: fired on tapping Continue with `amount` (int) and `terms` (bool).\n   - [`lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`](file:///private/tmp/h-CYF8rm/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart):\n     - `offers_scrolled`: fired via `ScrollEndNotification` on the offers list with `offset` (double).\n\n3. **Documentation**:\n   - Documented the changes in [ANSWER.md](file:///private/tmp/h-CYF8rm/ANSWER.md).\n","duration_seconds":89.368089,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":141610,"output_tokens":4334,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":133374,"total_tokens":145944}}}
